ref table dimdate
ref table dimproduct
ref table dimroute
ref table dimsupplier
ref table dimwarehouse
ref table factexception
ref table factfreightinvoice
ref table factinboundreceipt
ref table factinventorysnapshot
ref table factorder
ref table factshipment
ref table factwarehousetask
ref table Measure_tables
ref table dimaccounts

ref role Regional_Warehouse_Manager
ref role Executive_Read_All

